Hi <%= @user.email %>,

We're sorry, but there was an issue creating your course "<%= @course.localized_name %>".

Error Details:
<% if @error_class.present? %><%= @error_class %>: <% end %><%= @error_message %>

Debug information:
- Course:     <%= @course.localized_name %>
- Course ID:  <%= @course.id %>
- Slug:       <%= @course.slug %>
- Source URL: <%= @course.main_media_url %>
- Language:   <%= @course.language&.english_name || "-" %>
- Failed at:  <%= @failed_at.utc.iso8601 %>
<% if @error_cause.present? %>- Caused by:  <%= @error_cause.class.name %>: <%= @error_cause.message %>
<% end %>
<% if @backtrace.present? %>
Backtrace (top <%= @backtrace.size %>):
<% @backtrace.each do |line| %>  <%= line %>
<% end %><% end %>
